# Phase 10d — nginx + bind localhost (TaskMesh on :80)

**Branch:** `phase-10d-host-port80`

## Goal

Reach TaskMesh at the server LAN IP on port **80** (no `:3000`). Express binds `127.0.0.1` only; nginx reverse-proxies.

## Exit criteria

- `HOST=127.0.0.1` (default) + `PORT=3000` in `.env.example` / Express listen
- `deploy/nginx-taskmesh.conf` + systemd unit template under `deploy/`
- INSTALL: nginx install, site enable, UFW allow **80** (not 3000), future landing note
- README points at LAN URL pattern `http://<server-ip>/`

## Non-goals

TLS, multi-app portal UI, merging Phase 10c.
